# FAIL.rules (v0.2.6)

Status codes used in gate/reports/*.json:

- PASS: gate conditions satisfied.
- FAIL: gate conditions violated; the dependent claim is invalid in this version.
- INCONCLUSIVE: inputs or evidence files are missing/insufficient for judgement.
- UNLOGGED: special case used in the whitepaper when this PDF is distributed alone
  without the DOI bundle; equivalently "evidence not attached".

Propagation rule (conservative):
- If any required gate is FAIL → claim FAIL.
- Else if any required gate is INCONCLUSIVE/UNLOGGED → claim INCONCLUSIVE.
- Else PASS.
